            "required_age": "14",
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DARK HOPE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A First-Person Steampunk Puzzle Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You wake up alone. The exit is gone. The facility is abandoned. And something in the darkness is waiting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Dark Hope</i>, a first-person puzzle adventure set in a mysterious steampunk world of intricate machinery, forgotten experiments, and unsettling discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awakening inside a strange research facility with no memory of how you arrived, you find yourself surrounded by towering mechanical contraptions, cryptic symbols, and the remnants of experiments that seem to defy reality. Strange rifts of light cut through darkened corridors. Laboratories sit abandoned. Scattered notes hint at something that went terribly wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where did everyone go? What were they working on? And more importantly, how do you escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The answers are hidden throughout the facility. Finding them won't be easy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THINK. EXPLORE. EXPERIMENT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dark Hope, <strong>the environment itself is the puzzle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore interconnected laboratories, study mysterious devices, decipher clues, and bring forgotten machinery back to life. Every discovery brings you closer to understanding the facility and the events that led to its abandonment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't an adventure that hands you every answer. You'll need to pay attention, connect the clues, and sometimes think well outside the box.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Environmental Puzzles</strong> — Manipulate elaborate clockwork mechanisms, operate machinery, turn valves, and solve interconnected puzzles that require observation and logical thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mysterious Steampunk World</strong> — Explore atmospheric corridors, mechanical laboratories, and strange experimental environments filled with industrial technology and unexplained phenomena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover a Hidden Story</strong> — Search through research notes, laboratory journals, books, and scattered documents to piece together the truth behind the abandoned facility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Through Exploration</strong> — Important clues can be found throughout the environment. Pay attention to your surroundings; seemingly insignificant details may hold the key to your next breakthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Unsettling Atmosphere</strong> — Explore a haunting, isolated world where flickering lights, mysterious sounds, and the unknown create a constant sense of unease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles That Respect Your Intelligence</strong> — No constant hand-holding. Use your reasoning, experiment with the environment, and experience the satisfaction of solving each challenge yourself.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAN YOU UNCOVER THE TRUTH?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something happened inside this facility. Something that changed everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people are gone, the experiments remain, and the deeper you explore, the more questions emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find your way out, you'll need to understand what happened here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe carefully. Question everything. Trust your instincts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And one last piece of advice...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring a notebook. You're going to need it.</strong></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DARK HOPE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A First-Person Steampunk Puzzle Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You wake up alone. The exit is gone. The facility is abandoned. And something in the darkness is waiting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <i>Dark Hope</i>, a first-person puzzle adventure set in a mysterious steampunk world of intricate machinery, forgotten experiments, and unsettling discoveries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awakening inside a strange research facility with no memory of how you arrived, you find yourself surrounded by towering mechanical contraptions, cryptic symbols, and the remnants of experiments that seem to defy reality. Strange rifts of light cut through darkened corridors. Laboratories sit abandoned. Scattered notes hint at something that went terribly wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where did everyone go? What were they working on? And more importantly, how do you escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The answers are hidden throughout the facility. Finding them won't be easy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THINK. EXPLORE. EXPERIMENT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Dark Hope, <strong>the environment itself is the puzzle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore interconnected laboratories, study mysterious devices, decipher clues, and bring forgotten machinery back to life. Every discovery brings you closer to understanding the facility and the events that led to its abandonment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't an adventure that hands you every answer. You'll need to pay attention, connect the clues, and sometimes think well outside the box.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Environmental Puzzles</strong> — Manipulate elaborate clockwork mechanisms, operate machinery, turn valves, and solve interconnected puzzles that require observation and logical thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mysterious Steampunk World</strong> — Explore atmospheric corridors, mechanical laboratories, and strange experimental environments filled with industrial technology and unexplained phenomena.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover a Hidden Story</strong> — Search through research notes, laboratory journals, books, and scattered documents to piece together the truth behind the abandoned facility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover Through Exploration</strong> — Important clues can be found throughout the environment. Pay attention to your surroundings; seemingly insignificant details may hold the key to your next breakthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Unsettling Atmosphere</strong> — Explore a haunting, isolated world where flickering lights, mysterious sounds, and the unknown create a constant sense of unease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzles That Respect Your Intelligence</strong> — No constant hand-holding. Use your reasoning, experiment with the environment, and experience the satisfaction of solving each challenge yourself.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAN YOU UNCOVER THE TRUTH?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something happened inside this facility. Something that changed everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The people are gone, the experiments remain, and the deeper you explore, the more questions emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To find your way out, you'll need to understand what happened here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Observe carefully. Question everything. Trust your instincts.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And one last piece of advice...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bring a notebook. You're going to need it.</strong></p>",
